 It lasts almost two hours, so get cozy!\n\n3. Chasing Liberty (2004)\n\nFor anyone longing for a 2000's rom-com after two emotional films, I've got you! This is such a feel-good type of movie that it's perfect for anyone stuck at a boarding gate, bus terminal, or rainy day when camping! The"
