ni raj) (1990) \u2013 Yugoslav biographical drama film portraying a fictionalized depiction of Fritz Lang's life in 1935\n* The Austrian (French: L'Autrichienne) (1990) \u2013 French biographical drama film depicting the last days of Marie-Antoinette"
