usical about the life of legendary singer Bobby Darin.\n\nPerformances for Just In Time begin at the Circle in the Square Theatre on Friday, March 28, ahead of an opening on Wednesday, April 23.\n\nDarin was one of the music industry's biggest stars, and was a staple on the charts in the late "
