t at the box office.\n\nWho's In Valentine's Day?\n\nAshton Kutcher plays a florist that proposes and gets rejected by Jessica Alba's character. Jennifer Garner plays a woman who falls in love with a dreamy doctor played by Patrick Dempsey. Taylor Swift and Taylor Lautner portray high school sweeties who are just figuring out their relationship. Other notable actors include Julia Roberts, Bradley Cooper, Jessica Biel, George Lopez, and Anne Hathaway. Stream Valentine's Day on Hoopla.\n\n19 The Rid"
