\nDirected By:\n\nWilliam Wyler\n\n#3\n\nCritics Consensus: Well-acted and dramatically moving, The Pianist is Polanski's best work in years.\n\nSynopsis: In this adaptation of the autobiography \"The Pianist: The Extraordinary True Story of One Man's Survival in"
