ank Sinatra in Palm Springs. Credit: Palm Springs Historical Society.\n\nContinue West on W. Chino Drive. Turn right onto N. Patencio Road\n\nFibber Magee and Mollie \u2013 591 N. Patencio (l)\n\nFibber Magee and Mollie was a"
