e the holidays this year. \"My family is blended and diverse, nutty, and loving and understanding,\" she said in a 2015 PEOPLE interview. \"That's a family.\"\n\n- Nicole Kidman (Adoptive Mother)\n\nNicole Kidman is well-known for many roles, but her most recent work really struck a chord with us (and with her) \u2013 In early "
