e nice, honest and handsome prison doctor believes she's innocent and tries to help her.\n\n- A woman goes to prison for prostitution and loses contact with her 7-year-old son.\n\n- Lalinha, after being abandoned by her husband, seeks comfort in her farm. There, she discovers a new world.\n\n- A young and poor chauffeur from Santa Catarina is hired by a middle class family of S\u00e3o Paulo"
